Little Nick:

“He is demonstrably not right.”

Then from somewhere inside the chimney:

“THE QUARTER SAYS I’M RIGHT.”

Jessica:

“STOP CONSULTING THE FUCKING QUARTER.”

And somewhere, deep inside Unit 4 headquarters, the Cage Weather Map changes from red…

to black.

Marjorie looks at it.

“…oh, son of a bitch.”

Because Richmond was never the destination.

It was the chimney.